Package: FastconText
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Fast Embedding Regression for 'a la Carte' on Text (ConText) Models
Description: A drop-in, faster implementation of the 'conText' package (version 3.0.1)
    by Rodriguez, Spirling, Stewart, and Avila. It keeps the same functions, arguments,
    and output objects, so existing code can run simply by replacing with `library(FastconText)`.
    This package provides compute engines working in multi-threaded double precision C++ on any platform,
    with an optional Apple GPU (Metal) engine on macOS. The underlying methods are the 'a la carte'
    embeddings of Khodak et al. (2018) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.1805.05388>, the embedding regression
    framework of Rodriguez et al. (2023) <doi:10.1017/S0003055422001228>, and the distance estimator in
    high-dimensional space of Green et al. (2025) <doi:10.1017/pan.2024.22>.
